# Documentation Guidelines

Canonical sources:
- docs/domain.md — domain model
- docs/business-rules.md — business rules
- docs/architecture.md — project structure
- docs/api.md — API / OpenAPI
- docs/decisions/ — short ADRs for infra/product choices

Do not invent business rules.
If an implementation needs an undocumented business decision, stop and present alternatives.

Update docs when structure, API contracts, or accepted decisions change.
Keep ADRs short and concrete.
